# Loose runtime ranges — source of truth for what we depend on; the pinned
# versions the image actually installs live in requirements.txt.
# To upgrade: verify ranges here, install fresh, run pytest, then update the
# == pins in requirements.txt to the versions that passed. For a full
# transitive freeze, run inside the deploy base image (needs Linux/Docker):
#   docker run --rm -v "$PWD:/src" python:3.11-slim \
#     sh -c "pip install -q -r /src/requirements.in && pip freeze"
